sentences.text:
( a) Issue an appropriate Writ of mandamus or any other appropriate Writ, Order, or Direction, directing the opposite parties to recalculate the land acquisition compensation of the petitioners by adding the land value of Rs.4,46,186/- (Rupees Four Lakh Forty Six Thousand One Hundred Eighty Six only) along with applying the correct multiplier of 2.00, in accordance with Notification S.O. 425(E) dated 09.02.2016 vide Annexure-2 along with interest;
(b) Direct the opposite parties to pay the revised compensation amount along with interest to the petitioners along with the interest as per provision of the RFCTLARR Nrusingh Charan Jena vs State Of Orissa And on 10 April, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/180467406/
1 Act, 2013;
(c) Declare that the incorrect application of multiplier 1.2 instead of 2.00 is illegal and arbitrary, and direct its rectification;
(d) Award costs of this petition and pass any other order(s) as deemed fit and proper in the interest of justice.

